    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d62">

                <pb facs="0334" n="48" sameAs="frus:frus1916Supp/pg48"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72/2831</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Roumania</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Vopicka</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bucharest</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-08-28T17:00:00+01:44">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 28, 1916, 5 p. m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received August 29, 1.50 p.
                        m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>299. Have been informed by Minister for Foreign Affairs that the Roumanian
                    Minister Plenipotentiary to Austria-Hungary communicated to the Austro-Hungarian
                    Government that beginning from the 27th current at 9 o’clock in the evening
                    Roumania would consider herself at war with Austria-Hungary.</p>
                <p>German Minister informed me that the allies of Austria-Hungary would also
                    consider this as a declaration of war. Ministers of Central powers will leave
                    Bucharest to-night or to-morrow morning, route not yet known, by special
                    train.</p>
                <p>Telegram numbered 279 [274?] should be 278 [298?]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Vopicka</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
